{"id":"fe9fd7be-e1e0-41de-bc92-1a067fd7a4cd","kind":"note","ref":{"span":"1340ffd3e71cef82","key":"bablr1","file":"packages/editor/extensions/insights/monitor.ts","baseline":{"blob":"78a48685c996f96ab5df84a6880ba60c696db99f","start":0,"end":66},"shape":{"type":"ImportDeclaration","atoms":["import","type","{","MetricsSample","}","from","\"","@brianjenkins94/observability","\""]},"context":{"after":"f2517b5f32f25ee8"}},"payload":{"text":"The editor's own performance, in the status bar (the metrics plane, ARCHITECTURE.md, *The metrics plane*): its memory,\nhow full its workspace is, the share of time in long frames, and spans that are failing, each read once a second\nthrough the `editor.metrics.read` command (the bridge's: metrics-bridge.ts), so it uses nothing but VS Code's API.\nWhat each did over the last two minutes is in its hover, as a sparkline: no view to open (the user, 2026-11-06: no\nout-of-the-way panels).","wrote":["Brian Jenkins"]},"author":"local","createdAt":"2026-11-22T17:42:42.089Z","updatedAt":"2026-11-22T17:42:42.089Z"}
